<title>USA: PerSeptive names Ryan to board.</title>
<headline>PerSeptive names Ryan to board.</headline>
<dateline>FRAMINGHAM, Mass. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>PerSeptive Biosystems Inc said on Monday that Bruce Ryan, executive vice president and chief financial officer of Amdahl Corp, was named to its board.</p>
<p>The appointment increases the total to six directors.</p>
<p>PerSeptive Biosystems develops, manufactures and markets an integrated line of proprietary consumable products and advanced instrumentation systems.</p>
<p>Product sales topped $75 million in fiscal 1996, ended September.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
